      ],
      "source": "https://www.wisdomlib.org/cities/prairie-ridge-35479",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Before widespread settlement, the land that became Prairie Ridge was dominated by expansive prairies.",
